 * tiles whose APIs still take a Material ImageVector. Geometry is the same default-pack
 * (Hugeicons Free style: 24dp viewport, 1.5 stroke, rounded caps/joins) artwork shipped
 * in res/drawable; black fill/stroke is the neutral carrier - call sites apply tint.
 * The new unique glyphs are original Chaty art; reused ids mirror the bundled vectors.
 */
